    },
    {
      "claim": "L4 phosphate-prodrug solubility/dissolution records (C40, C42, C43, C48, C49) and oxazolidinone solubility/permeability records (C45, C46, C47) support the absorption component; C44 and C50 are unrelated low-permeability/dissolution records with low transferability.",
